0..77 Comment "// A sealed atom whose type member states an identity system: a relation, its"
78..154 Comment "// reflexivity and the transport law contracting the singleton of each point"
155..233 Comment "// onto its reflexivity. The relation is then the atom\'s identity type, so its"
234..310 Comment "// evidence between two points is a path between them (Univalent Foundations"
311..375 Comment "// Program, _Homotopy Type Theory_, 2013, §5.8, Theorem 5.8.2)."
